        The launcher icon follows the wallpaper: the letters take a light tone
        of the accent, 300, which their grey body shades and their white
        highlights brighten; the ground is the palest tone of the accent by
        day and a deep neutral by night, as for the other apps.
    -->
    <color name="ic_launcher_background">@android:color/system_accent1_50</color>
    <color name="ic_launcher_letters">@android:color/system_accent1_300</color>
</resources>
